Every step's "Run `rules sync`" substep means `npm run build:rules` — the script
that compiles `rules/` and runs `builder.ts`. No `rules sync` command exists.
`npm run lint` now runs `eslint src server common`, and `server/**` has left the
top-level `ignores`, so the whole tree is linted. `rules/` and `scripts/` still are
not.

